{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Howzit. Come sit this side, I'll get your obs done before the doctor.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja. Make it quick, hey, it's been a long morning.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (NURSE): Arm out please. Blood pressure is one thirty two over seventy eight. Pulse seventy six.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Mm.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (NURSE): Weight seventy one point five kilograms. Oxygen sat ninety eight percent. He'll be through now now.",
  "[SEG0006] person_3 (CAREGIVER): The parking was mad, hey. Two loops around the block.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (PATIENT): Don't start with that. I'm not in the mood.",
  "[SEG0008] person_4 (DOCTOR): Right. What's the problem.",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): My stomach. Bloating most days, and loose stools, after milk and after ice cream. It's been four-ish months.",
  "[SEG0010] person_4 (DOCTOR): How long.",
  "[SEG0011] person_2 (PATIENT): I said. Four-ish months. I'm sick of it.",
  "[SEG0012] person_3 (CAREGIVER): She's been cross the whole way here, doctor. Long morning.",
  "[SEG0013] person_4 (DOCTOR): Bloating most days?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja. Worse with the milk or the ice cream. Ugh.",
  "[SEG0015] person_4 (DOCTOR): Stools. How many times.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Two or three. Loose. Not every day, but, umm, plenty of days.",
  "[SEG0017] person_4 (DOCTOR): Blood in the stool?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0019] person_4 (DOCTOR): Vomiting?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Can we not drag every little thing. No vomiting.",
  "[SEG0021] person_4 (DOCTOR): Fever?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0023] person_4 (DOCTOR): Weight loss?",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): No. None.",
  "[SEG0025] person_3 (CAREGIVER): Scale at the flat hasn't budged, hey.",
  "[SEG0026] person_4 (DOCTOR): Any tummy pain?",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Just the bloating.",
  "[SEG0028] person_4 (DOCTOR): Bread set it off?",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): No. It's the dairy.",
  "[SEG0030] person_4 (DOCTOR): Still taking dairy?",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): I left it for a week. No milk, no ice cream. Then I, um, went back on the ice cream.",
  "[SEG0032] person_4 (DOCTOR): And that week?",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (PATIENT): Bloating eased off. Stools still loose some days. Then the ice cream and the bloating came right back.",
  "[SEG0034] person_3 (CAREGIVER): I got her lactose free milk at the chemist. She lasted the week, then stopped.",
  "[SEG0035] person_4 (DOCTOR): Medicines. What are you on.",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): Amlodipine for the pressure. Ten milligram, uh no, five milligram, mornings.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (PATIENT): And the cholesterol one at night, twenty milligram. My sugar tablets as well.",
  "[SEG0038] person_4 (DOCTOR): Sugar tablets. Name and dose.",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (PATIENT): Metformin. Five hundred milligram. Err, one in the morning and one at supper.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (DOCTOR): Herbal, or anything from the shop?",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (PATIENT): Only the ayervedic powder in the morning. Half a teaspoon. Nothing else.",
  "[SEG0042] person_3 (CAREGIVER): She mixes that powder every single morning. And she doesn't miss her tablets, I pour them.",
  "[SEG0043] person_4 (DOCTOR): On the bed. I need to feel your tummy.",
  "[SEG0044] person_4 (DOCTOR): Soft. Bit distended. No tenderness, no masses. Up you sit.",
  "[SEG0045] person_4 (DOCTOR): Most likely lactose intolerance from the dairy. Coeliac is not excluded.",
  "[SEG0046] person_2 (PATIENT): That's the wheat thing, isn't it. Wheat doesn't do this.",
  "[SEG0047] person_4 (DOCTOR): Ja. Still sending a blood test for coeliac, the antibody test.",
  "[SEG0048] person_1 (NURSE): I'll book those bloods for tomorrow morning. No fasting for that one.",
  "[SEG0049] person_2 (PATIENT): Tomorrow. Of course. Fine.",
  "[SEG0050] person_4 (DOCTOR): Diet diary, two weeks. What you eat, the bloating, the loose stools.",
  "[SEG0051] person_3 (CAREGIVER): I'll write the diary. She won't, not when she's like this.",
  "[SEG0052] person_4 (DOCTOR): Come back in two weeks with the diary and the results. No milk, no ice cream until then. Lactose free is fine.",
  "[SEG0053] person_2 (PATIENT): Ag, alright. Are we done."
 ],
